al leader in mobile imaging intelligence technology. Built on over twenty years of research and development, we use our world-class Intelligent Imaging\u2122 to enable visual \u2018thinking&#39; capabilities in more than 1.5 billion of today\u2019s most popular smartphones.<br>Website: perfect365.com<br>Instagram: @perfect365_official<br>Facebook: www.facebook.com/perfect365 <br>Twitter: @perfect365",
